3. Kamado Joe - For those who want precise temperature control and a large cooking area, the Kamado Joe Classic Joe II is an excellent option. Its Air Lift Hinge, Kontrol Tower vent, and Divide & Conquer system make it easy to smoke, roast, or bake.
