6. Blackstone - Finally, if you're looking for something portable and compact, the Blackstone 17\" Tabletop Griddle is an excellent choice. Its 12,000 BTUs via an H-style burner provide even heat, making it perfect for tailgating or camping trips. And with its hood and Rear Grease Management System, cleanup is a breeze.</s>

